<header class="demo-header">
  <h1>Visits</h1>
  <p>
    Every page opened on this demo, counted and drawn by Janela. No cookie, no address and no browser
    is kept, only which page and which day. Click around the site and come back: you are in the numbers.
    Click a page or a day here and the rest of the dashboard narrows to it.
  </p>
</header>

<% if @frame %>
  <div class="demo-frame"><%= janela_frame @frame %></div>
<% else %>
  <p class="demo-header">The visits dashboard has not been set up yet.</p>
<% end %>
